nodecode-web-provider ports the web provider of oh-my-pi
(https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi, commit c9383c1f327521006715f9eb6a33f541cb215521):
the keyless search engines of its web-search runner (coding-agent/src/web/
search/providers/: google.ts, startpage.ts, ecosia.ts, mojeek.ts,
duckduckgo.ts, searxng.ts, the public.ts aggregate, browser-headers.ts).
